      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201100902/2011009020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちゃんと動画も撮ってるからな\r\nあとで一緒に見て研究しよう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009020020,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "おー、ありがとな",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100902/2011009020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009020030,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……自分が料理するとこ見んのとか、\r\nなんか恥ずかしいけど……",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100902/2011009020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──『アイドル料理コロシアム』、\r\n正月スペシャル特番だからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "着物で料理するの、\r\n練習して慣れておきたいんだろ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009020040,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "ああ、ただ料理できればいいって\r\nわけでもないだろうし……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100902/2011009020040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009020050,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "途中で話振られたりしても、\r\nちゃんと返せるようにしておかないとな……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100902/2011009020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "じゃあ料理してる樹里に、\r\n質問を振っていくよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "手を止めないで返せるように\r\n練習だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009020060,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "わかった\r\n──じゃあ、最初は伊達巻から……",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
