  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……西城さんの好きなおせちの具はなんですか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009020070,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "え、あー……\r\n栗きんとん、とか……黒豆とか……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201100902/2011009020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甘いものが好きなんですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009020080,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "甘いもの……\r\nあー……どっちもそうか……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100902/2011009020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009020090,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "……おせちって、\r\n子どもにはあんまり人気ないんだよな",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100902/2011009020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009020100,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "アタシも、昔はあんま\r\n好きじゃなかったから",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100902/2011009020100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009020110,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "そういう甘いのばっか食べて、\r\n怒られた気がするな……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "juri",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201100902/2011009020110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "…………樹里\r\n少し手が遅くなってるぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2011009020120,
    "speaker": "樹里",
    "text": "あ……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
